# What builds the engine's wheel (the [build-system] in engine/pyproject.toml). build-installer.ps1
# has uv use only the versions in build-constraints.txt, and check their hashes.
#
# To refresh those, run the command at the top of build-constraints.txt from the repo root, with
# --upgrade. It leaves out what was released in the last two weeks (P14D), so that a bad release
# has time to be noticed.
hatchling
